// A SOLD UNIT STILL HOLDS AN ADDRESS. The operator reported on 2026-11-17 that srv11 (spark-b66c) is sold, and the
// tailnet-anchor work in PR #16655 moves 192.168.1.238 to srv14/butch as a dated lease observation retired from
// that same cage. The model still answers the other way: srv11_host_lan_endpoint stands as a live host endpoint at
// that address, and gunbc.fleet.fleet_host_identity::operator_host_srv11 keeps the unit in the fleet. Two hosts at
// one address is the shape that routes an effect to the wrong machine, and the retirement belongs to a run, not to
// a hand edit -- this row does not perform either.
data srv11_spark_b66c_reported_sold_its_lan_endpoint_row_still_stands: IntegrationConcern = IntegrationConcern {
